# Heads, 16×12, drawn at the top of the 16×24 frame (+ the pose's dy).
# Keys (palette "char"): A B C skin ramp (light, base, shadow), o outline (takes the ramp of its part),
# e eye/ink, m mouth, r blush. Hair, glasses, headset and the cap are separate overlays (hair.px, gear.px).
# Directions: s (towards the viewer), n (away), e (facing right). w is e mirrored by the build.

